{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/bf74b9c4227378020fb764f1a197c2a4.avif?t=1764036917\" width=616 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of <strong>chaos and conquest</strong> in <i>Soul Tides</i>, a <strong>fast-paced multiplayer auto-battler</strong> where strategy is everything. Command <strong>fallen warriors, cursed beasts, and arcane horrors</strong> as you battle to regain the favor of the dark lord. Master the art of <strong>summoning, resource management, and unit customization</strong> in this <strong>fantasy tug-of-war showdown!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Features \u2694\ufe0f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Build &amp; Expand</strong> \u2013 Construct Shrines and fortifications to unlock powerful <strong>Blessings and units</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.poster.avif?t=1764036917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.webm?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/4cd05312f13fa74118fa23e017fa1598.mp4?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Customize Your Army</strong> \u2013 Research and assign <strong>unique abilities</strong> to your minions, creating devastating synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/0c774ab20c135271584bf8de109d95bc.poster.avif?t=1764036917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/0c774ab20c135271584bf8de109d95bc.webm?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/0c774ab20c135271584bf8de109d95bc.mp4?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Pray for Power</strong> \u2013 Unlock new <strong>units and abilities</strong> to dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/95d308c56596945c41ad035f7e1aa82a.poster.avif?t=1764036917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/95d308c56596945c41ad035f7e1aa82a.webm?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/95d308c56596945c41ad035f7e1aa82a.mp4?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f <strong>Tug-of-War Combat</strong> \u2013 Deploy minions that <strong>fight automatically</strong>, pushing the frontlines toward your enemy\u2019s stronghold in a relentless battle for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.poster.avif?t=1764036917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.webm?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/faea486453314c31bf2bf5a1fdf00d1b.mp4?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Deep Tech Tree</strong> \u2013 Unlock new strategies with a <strong>dynamic research system</strong> that ensures no two matches play out the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong> \u2013 Challenge friends and rivals in <strong>intense PvP battles</strong>, where strategy and adaptation are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.poster.avif?t=1764036917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.webm?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/ac7aac9ac929fb32f86f786b53f7cdfa.mp4?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Singleplayer Challenges</strong> - Test your might in the <strong>Trials</strong>, see how high you can score on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 <strong>Resource Management</strong> \u2013 Balance <strong>Gold, Supply, and Souls\u00a0</strong>to maintain an army capable of overwhelming your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/18f5d04487ea2ff02cf8c1a2165cdd4c.poster.avif?t=1764036917\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/18f5d04487ea2ff02cf8c1a2165cdd4c.webm?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/18f5d04487ea2ff02cf8c1a2165cdd4c.mp4?t=1764036917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in a world of <strong>forbidden magic, demonic bargains, and relentless warfare</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you rise once more, or be cast into oblivion?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle. <strong>Claim your power.</strong> Rule the battlefield.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459720?t=1764036917","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459720?t=1764036917","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/368189e5ac555e64edddd0a34c931f8c3d9dee23/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764036917","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/368189e5ac555e64edddd0a34c931f8c3d9dee23/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764036917","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459720/extras/bf74b9c4227378020fb764f1a197c2a4.avif?t=1764036917\" width=616 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of <strong>chaos and conquest</strong> in <i>Soul Tides</i>, a <strong>fast-p